# SKID KIDS: MILO (Benjy's kit). His throws fly in a low arc, cleared only
# from the top of a jump, and his light toss goes high and far; his special
# throw is the POPPER (it goes off where it stops: everyone of the other
# team near it is knocked down, a point each); his move is the REEL.
game skidkids
wait 5
cheat match 3 1 2 11 0
cheat coach 0
cheat clearbags
cheat freeze 1
cheat freeze 2
cheat freeze 3
cheat play
cheat kid 0 60 100
cheat kid 2 280 60
cheat kid 3 280 170
cheat give 0 1
hold B 40
wait 5
expect bagst0 == 3
expect bagz0 > 4
# the light toss lands a long way off
cheat clearbags
cheat give 0 1
hold B 12
wait 50
expect bagst0 == 1
expect bagx0 > 110
# the popper: hits one kid, goes off, and gets both
cheat clearbags
cheat kid 0 100 100
cheat kid 2 190 100
cheat kid 3 195 112
cheat stars 0 2
cheat give 0 1
hold B 70
wait 2
expect bagkind0 == 3
waituntil n_boom == 1 90
expect score0 >= 2
expect kst2 == 5
expect kst3 == 5
# the reel
waituntil kst3 == 0 100
cheat clearbags
cheat kid 0 60 60
cheat loose 120 160
cheat stars 0 2
press A
wait 5
press A
waituntil held0 == 1 60
